            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.4+JER.52.5+JER.52.6+JER.52.7+JER.52.8+JER.52.9+JER.52.10+JER.52.11+JER.52.12+JER.52.13+JER.52.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "52:4-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I oro mar'apar g'ario ma twec mawan, i dwe mar'apar g'abic, nyatoro mogo m'oyido okwale wok Yerusalem obino bongan to waco ran ni, “Tindi madwoŋ me otieko podho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo pama cingi Rwoth otieko bedo kwoŋan othieno mafodi jokwalok me jok'obino; aka oyido atieko yawo dhokan i hongo ma jalo obin'iye bongan odikin; kole dhokan oyido oyawere, aka akibedo obadha kendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reco pa ji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth doko waco ran ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wod dhano, ji ma jobedo i kabedo m'onyekere i piny ma Isiraili jomena waco ni, Abraham am'obedo ŋat'acel kende, kucel onwaŋo lowo; to pama onyo wathothi; adieri lowo omiy wan ni wabed'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno wac rijo, Rwoth Were waco ama: Wicamo riŋo gi remo, to witiŋo waŋ win malo ri cal mewin, aka wineko ji; winoloki lowo mewin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wigeno abor, witimo gir'amien aka kisi ŋat'acel acele kwoŋ win koco cipa nyawote; onyo ameno, winoloki lowo mewin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo ilawaco rijo ama: Rwoth Were waco ama: Paka fodi akwo, jono ma jobedo i kabedo m'onyekere no, jolapodho g'abor; aka ŋata nitie iy'abar alamiyo ogwaŋe mager jowocuti; aka jono ma jonitie i kapondo matek kodi i ŋungu, jolatho two nundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaloko lowo marac m'ongoye kony; aka kwoto pere ma meni bino tundo i gike; gote ma Isiraili jolalokere m'osika ma nyatoro k'onyal luw'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaka jobino ŋeyo ni An Rwoth, k'atieko loko lowo m'osika m'ongoye kony ro amien pajo je ma jotieko timo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gim'owok i mikwenda pa jatuci wac Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ri in, wod dhano, ji perin ma joluwo kwoŋin kanyacel i kor udi gi dhiot udi pajo, ka joluwo kisi ŋat'acel gi nyawote, omin g'omin ni, “Biye winji nger wac ma wok bongi Rwoth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino bongin paka ji jobino, jobedo ro nyim win paka ji paran, aka jowinjo wac mewin, to jok'owor jo. Kole jonyutho mar mathoth gi dhok jo, to cuny gin nitie i magowa pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ri jo icale kodi ŋati ma wero wer ma mitirok gi dwondi mamit, aka gido thum maber, rupiri jowinjo gim'iwaco, to jokitim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gime obino aka latimere, nyaka jolaŋeyo ni jatuci wac Were owok bedo i dier jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
